## Local secrets and per-machine config.
## There is no appsettings.json in the repo: the SQL and Dropbox settings live in the
## Windows registry and the registry is the source of truth. The app still reads a
## per-machine appsettings.{MACHINE}.json - optional, and reloaded on change - for the
## values the registry does not carry, and that file is where a real connection string
## lands. Nothing named appsettings* may be committed.
appsettings*.json
*.env
secrets.json

